hadiths[119]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5440","Hammam ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : ham ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kis qism ka libas zyada mahboob tha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada achchha lagta tha? unhon-ne kaha : dhari daar (yamni) chadar."
"5441","Hisham ne Qatada se unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kapdon mein sabse zyada pasand dhaari daar (yamni chadar thi.)"
"5442","Sulaiman-bin Mughira ne kaha : hamein Humaid ne abu-Burda se hadis sunai, kaha : main Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon-ne aik mota tehband jo Yaman mein banaya jata hai aur aik uper ki chadar (moti sakht aur pewand lagey hone ki wjah se) jisey ( مُلَبَّدَہ ( kaha jata hai nikal kar dikhai, kaha : unhon-ne Allah ki qism khaai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhi 2 kapdon mein daai ajal ko labbaik kaha tha."
"5443","Ali-bin Hujr Sadi Muhammad-bin-Hatim aur Yaqoob-bin-Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne (Ismail) ibne-Ulaih se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ayub se, unhon-ne Humaid bin Hilal se, unhon-ne abu-Burda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hamein aik tehband aur aik pewand lagi hui moti chadar nikal kar dikhai aur farmaya : unhi 2 kapdon main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui thi. ibne- Hatim ne apni hadis mein kaha : mota tehband."
"5444","Mamar ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur kaha : mota tehband."
"5445","Safiya-binte-Sheba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik subah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is tarah bahar nikley ke aap ke jism par aik moti murabba lakeeron wali kaley baalon se bani hui chadar thi. (aam si, khurdari aur kam qeemat chadar.)"
"5446","Abda bin Sulaiman ne hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa se hadis sunai, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka takiya jiske sath aap tek lagaatey they chamdey ka bana hua tha jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi."
"5447","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa se khabar di, unhon-ne apne walid se unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bistar ( gaddaa ( jis par aap sotey they, chamdey ka tha jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi."
"5448","ibne-Numair aur abu-Muawiya donon ne hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath khabar di aur kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka soney ka bichhona aur abu-Muawiya ki hadis mein hai. jis par aap sotey they."
"5449","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed, Amr Naaqid aur Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne ibne-Munkadir se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab maine shadi ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se puchha : kya tum ne bichhonon ke ghilaf banaey hain? maine arz ki, hamarey paas ghilaaf kahan se aaey? aap ne farmaya : ab an-qareeb hongey."
"5450","Wakee ne hamein Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab maine shadi ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se puchha : kya tum ne bichhonon ke ghilaaf banaey hain? maine arz ki, hamarey paas ghilaaf kahan se aaey? aap ne farmaya : ab an-qareeb ho jaengey. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : meri biwi ke paas aik ghilaaf tha main us se kehta tha : usey mujh se door rakho, aur wo kehti thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : an-qareeb ghilaaf hua karengey."
"5451","Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur ye izafa kya : to main usey (iske haal par) chhod deta."
"5452","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : aik bistar mard ke liye hai aik uski biwi ke liye tesraa bistar mehman ke liye aur chotha bistar shaitan ke liye hai."
"5453","Imam Malik ne Naafe , Abdullah-bin-Dinar aur Zaid-bin-Aslam se riwayat ki, un sab ne unhein Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs takabbur se kapda ghaseet kar chaley Allah Taala uski taraf nazar tak nahi karega."
"5454","Ubaidullah , Ayub , Lais-bin-Sad aur Usama un sab ne Naafe se unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Malik ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki aur ye izafa kya : qiyamat ke din ( nazar nahi karega .)"
"5455","Umar-bin Muhammad ne apne walid Salim bin-Abdullah aur Naafe se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs takabbur se kapda ghaseet kar chalta hai qiyamat ke din Allah Taala uski taraf nazar nahi farmaeyga ."
"5456","Maharib bin Disaar aur jabla bin Suhem ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5457","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne kaha : hamein Hanzala ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Salim se unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki : kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne takabbur se kapda ghaseeta Allah Taala qiyamat ke din uski taraf nazar tak nahi farmaeyga."
"5458","Ishaq bin Sulaiman ne kaha : hamein Hanzala bin abi Sufiyan ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Salim se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they usi ki tarah magar unhon-ne ( kapda ghaseetaa ke bajaey) kapdey (ghaseetey) kaha."
"5459","Shoba ne kaha : maine Muslim-bin-Yunaaq se suna, wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke unhon-ne aik shakhs ko chadar ghaseet kar chaltey huey dekha unhon-ne us se puchha : tum kis qabeeley se ho? us ne nasb bataya wo shakhs banu- Leis se tha, Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko pehchan liya aur kaha : maine apne un donon kanon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke aap farma rahe they. jis shakhs ne apni izaar (kamar se nichey ki chadar wghaira) ghaseeti us se iska irada takabbur ke siwa aur na tha to qiyamat ke din Allah Taala uski taraf nazar tak nahi farmaeyga."
"5460","Abdul-Malik bin abi Sulaiman abu Yunus aur Ibrahim bin Naafe un sab ne Muslim-bin Yunaaq se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki magar abu Yunus ki hadis mein hai : abul-Hasan Muslim se riwayat hai aur un sab ki riwayat mein hai, jisne apni izaar ghaseeti unhon-ne apna kapda nahi kaha."
"5461","hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Muhammad-bin Ibad bin Jafar se suna, keh rahe they : maine Naafe bin abd al-Haaris ke ghulam Muslim-bin Yasar se kaha ke wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se sawal karein kaha : aur main un donon ke darmyan betha tha (unhon-ne sawal kya : ( kya aap ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us shakhs ke barey mein koi baat suni jo takabbur se apni izaar ghaseet-ta hai? unhon-ne kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna tha : qiyamat ke din Allah Taala uski taraf nazar tak nahi farmaeyga ."
"5462","Abdullah-bin Waqid ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb se guzra meri kamar ki chadar kisi had tak latak rahi thi to aap ne farmaya Abdullah ! apni chadar uper kar lo. maine apni chadar uper kar li. aap ne farmaya : aur zyada kar lo maine aur zyada uper ki, phir main usko uper karta raha yahan tak ke kuchh logon ne kaha kahan tak ( uper karey) ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pindliyon ke aadhey hisson tak."
"5463","Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Muhammad-bin-Ziyad se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, aur unhon-ne aik shakhs ko chadar ghaseet kar chaltey huey dekha us shakhs ne zamin par paon mar maar kehna shuru kar diya : ameer aagey ameer aa gaey. wo (abu-Huraira (Raziallahu anhu)) Bahrain ke ameer they. (ye dekh kar Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha jo shakhs itraatey huey zamin par apni izaar ghaseet-ta hai Allah Taala uski taraf nazar tak na farmaeyga ."
"5464","Muhammad-bin Bashshaar ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki. aur ibne- Musanna ne kaha : hamein ibne-abi Adi ne hadis sunai, un donon ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, ibne- Jafar ki riwayat mein hai : Marwan Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko apni ghair haziri mein Madina ka (qaaim maqam) Hakim banaya karta tha aur ibne- Musanna ki hadis mein hai : Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko (hakim ki ghair-haziri mein) Madina ka Hakim banaya jata tha."
"5465","Rabe-bin-Muslim ne Muhammad-bin ziyad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki aap ne farmaya : aik shakhs apne baalon aur apni chaadaron par itraata hua chal raha tha ke achcha usko zamin mein dhansa diya gaya aur wo qiyamat tak zamin mein dhansta chala jaeyga."
"5466","Shoba ne hamein Muhammad-bin-Ziyad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"5467","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs akadta hua apni 2 chaadaron mein chala ja raha tha, apne aap par itraa raha tha Allah Taala ne usey zamin mein dhansa diya wo qiyamat tak zamin mein dhansta chala jaeyga."
"5468","Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se khabar di kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein sunain, phir unhon-ne kuchh hadison sunain, unmein se (eik ( ye thi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs 2 chaadaron mein itraata hua ja raha tha phir usi ki tarah bayan kya."
"5469","abu Raafe ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they. tum se pahley ki aik ummat mein aik shakhs chaadaron ke aik jodey mein itraata hua ja raha tha phir un sab ki hadis ki tarah zikr kya."
"5470","Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Qatada se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne nazar bin Anas se, unhon-ne Bashir bin Nuhaik se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne soney ki anguthi (pahnney, istemal karne) se mana farmaya."
"5471","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur ibne-Bashar ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur ibne- Musanna ki hadis mein hai, kaha : maine nazar bin Anas se suna."
"5472","Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam Kureb ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ke hath (ki ungli) mein soney ki anguthi dekhi, aap ne usko utaar kar phenk diya aur farmaya tum mein se koi shakhs aag ka angaara uthata hai aur usey apne hath mein daal leta hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke tashrif ley janey ke baad us shakhs se kaha gaya : apni anguthi ley lo aur us se koi fayda utha lo. usne kaha : Allah ki qasam! main usey kabhi nahi uthaunga. jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey phenk diya hai."
"5473","Yahya-bin-Yahya tamimi Muhammad-bin Rumeh aur Quteba ne kaha : hamein Leis ne Naafe se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai aap usey pahntey to uska nageena hatheli ke andar ki taraf kar liya kartey they, to logon ne bhi soney ki anguthiyan banwaa lein, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par tashrif farma huey. us anguthi ko utaar diya aur farmaya : main us anguthi ko pehnta tha to nageeney ko andar ki taraf kar leta tha. phir aap ne usey phenk diya aur farmaya : Allah ki qasam! main usko kabhi nahi pahnunga. phir logon ne bhi apni apni anguthiyan phenk din. hadis ke alfaz Yahya ke) bayan ki hui ( hain."
"5474","Muhammad-bin-Bishr Yahya-bin-Saeed Khalid-bin Haris aur Aqba bin Khalid sab ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se soney ki anguthi ke barey mein hadis riwayat ki, Aqba bin Khalid ki riwayat main (Ubaidullah ne) ye izafa kya : aur aap ne usey daain hath mein pehna."
"5475","Ayub Musa-bin-Aqba aur Usama sab ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se soney ki anguthi ke barey mein Leis ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5476","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai, pehley wo aap ke hath mein thi phir Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rahi phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rahi phir Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rahi yahan tak ke wo un (hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu)) se arees ke kuwein mein gir gaee, us (anguthi) par Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naqsh tha. ibne-Numair ki riwayat mein hai : yahan tak ke wo aik kuwein mein gir gaee, unhon-ne ye nahi kaha : unse ( gir gaee. ("
"5477","Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai, phir aap ne usko phenk diya, iske baad aap ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai, usmein ye naqsh karaya : Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur farmaya : koi shakhs meri us anguthi ke naqsh ke mutabiq naqsh na banwaaey . jab aap us anguthi ko pahntey to anguthi ke nageeney (motey chaudey hissey) ko hatheli ke andar ki taraf kar liya kartey they aur yahi wo anguthi thi jo Mueqeeb (ke hath ( se chaah arees mein gir gaee thi."
"5478","Hammad ne hamein Abdul-Azeez bin Suheb se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai, usmein Muhammad Rasulullah naqsh karaya aur logon se farmaya : maine chandi ki aik anguthi banai hai aur is mein Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naqsh karaya hai, so koi shakhs us naqsh ke mutabiq naqsh kanda na karaaey."
"5479","Ismail (ibne-Ulaih) ne Abdul-Azeez bin Suheb se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki aur is mein Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( naqsh karaaney (ka zikr nahi kya."
"5480","Shoba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Qatada ko Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Rome (mojooda Itly) (ke badshah) ki taraf khat likhney ka irada kya to sahaba ne kaha : wo log koi aisa khat nahi padhtey jis par mehar na lagai gaee ho, kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi ki banwaai, aisa lagta hai ke main ab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hathon mein uski safedi ko dekh raha hun, is par Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naqsh hai."
"5481","Muaz bin Hisham ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey mere walid ne Qatada se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ahale-ajam ki taraf khat likhney ka irada kya to aap se puchha gaya ke wo log sirf us khat ko qabool kartey hain jis par mehar lagi ho, is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai. kaha : mujhey aisa lagta hai ke main (ab bhi) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein us (anguthi) ki safedi ko dekh raha hun."
"5482","Khalid-bin Qais ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Kisraa , qaisar aur Najashi ki taraf khat likhney ka irada farmaya to aap se puchha gaya ke wo log sirf us khat ko qabool kartey hain jis par mehar lagi ho, is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mehar dhalwaai, wo chandi ki anguthi thi aur is mein Muhammad Rasulullah naqsh karaya."
"5483","Ibrahim bin Sad ne hamein ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) bin Malik se riwayat ki aik unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein chandi ki aik anguthi dekhi, phir logon ne bhi chandi ki anguthiyan banwaaein aur pahan lin, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni anguthi phenk di to logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan phenk din."
"5484","Rooh ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey Ziyad ne bataya ke ibne-Shahab ne unhein khabar di, Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke unhon-ne aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein chandi ki aik anguthi dekhi, phir sab logon ne chandi ki anguthiyan dhalwaain aur pehan lin, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni anguthi phenk di to logon ne bhi apni apni anguthiyan phenk din."
"5485","abu-Aasim ne ibne-Juraij se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"5486","Abdullah-bin Wahab misri ne kaha : mujhey Yunus bin Yazeed ne ibne-Shahab se khabar di, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi chandi ki thi aur uska nagina habsh ka tha."
"5487","Talha bin Yahya Ansari ne Yunus se, unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne daaein hath mein chandi ki aik anguthi pahni, usmein habsh ka nagina tha, aap iske naginey ko hatheli ki taraf rakha kartey they."
"5488","Sulaiman-bin Bilal ne Yunus bin Yazeed se isi sanad ke sath Talha bin Yahya ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"5489","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi us ungli mein thi, ye keh kar unhon-ne baaein hath ki chhanguli ki taraf ishara kya."
"5490","ibne-Idrees ne kaha : maine Aasim bin Kulaib se suna, unhon-ne abu-Burda (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aap yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey us ungli ya uske paas wali ungli mein anguthi pahnney se mana farmaya, Aasim ko ye yad nahi raha ke Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kon-si 2 ungliyon mein (pahnney se mana kya tha). padhi. aur aap ne mujhey qass ke reshami kapdey pahnney aur reshami gaddon par baithney se mana farmaya, unhon-ne (Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha qassi (reshami) dhaariyon wala kapda Misr aur Sham (Syria) se aata tha, usmein kuchh shabeehein (tasweeron jaisey naqsh w nigaar ( hoti hain. aur Mayasir usko kehtey hain jo auratein apne khaawindon ki khaatir zeen par rakhney ke liye banati thin, jis tarah arghuani rang ke gaddey hon."
"5491","Sufiyan ne Aasim bin Kulaib se, unhon-ne abu-Musa ( Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu)) ke aik betey se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ke mutabiq riwayat ki."
"5492","Shoba ne Aasim bin Kulaib se riwayat ki, kaha : maine abu-Burda (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : mana farmaya, ya mujhey mana farmaya, unki murad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se thi (iske baad) isi tarah bayan kya."
"5493","abu-Ahwas ne Aasim bin Kulaib se, unhon-ne abu-Burda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha : mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya tha ke main un donon mein se kisi ungli mein anguthi pehnun, phir unhon-ne darmyani aur (angoothey ki taraf se) uske sath wali ungli ki taraf ishara kya."
"5494","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine aik ghazwey ke doran mein, jo ham ne lada, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : kasarat se (aksar oqaat) jootey pehna karo, kyonke aadmi jab tak jootey pahan kar rakhta hai sawar hota hai. (uske paon isi tarah mehfooz rahtey hain jis tarah sawar ke aur wo sawar hi ki tarah tezi se chal sakta hai.)"
"5495","Muhammad-bin-Ziyad ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs jootaa pahney to daain ( paon ( se shuru karey aur jab jootaa utaarey to baain ( paon ( se ibtida karey aur donon jootey pahney ya donon jootey utaar de."
"5496","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs aik jootey mein na chaley, donon jootey pahney ya donon jootey utaar de."
"5497","ibne-Idrees ne Aamash se, unhon-ne abu-Rizeen se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey paas aaey, unhon-ne apni peshani par hath mar kar farmaya : suno ! kya tum is tarah ki baatein kartey ho ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf baatein mansub karta hun. taake tum hidayat pa jao aur main khud gumrah ho jaun, sun lo ! main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jab tum mein se kisi shakhs ke jootey ka tasma toot jaey to wo usko theek karne se pahley doosrey ( jootey ( mein na chaley."
"5498","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne abu-Rizeen aur Abu-Saleh se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"5499","Malik-bin-Anas ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat se mana farmaya ke aadmi apne baain hath se khaaey, ya aik joota pehan kar chaley aur aisa kapda pahney jis mein bahar nikalney waley aaza (sar, hath, paon) ke liye suraakh na hon aur aik hi kapda is tarah kamar aur ghutnon ke gird baandhey ke uski sharmgah zahir ho."
"5586","Amr-bin-Murra ne kaha : maine Hasan-bin-Muslim se suna, wo Safiya-binte-Sheba se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Ansar ki aik ladki ne shadi ki, wo bimar ho gaee thi jis se iske baal jhad gaey they un logon ne iske baalon ke sath baal jodney ka irada kya to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq sawal kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baalon mein jod lagaaney wali aur jod lagwaaney wali) donon ( par laanat farmai."
"5587","Amr-bin-Murra ne kaha : maine Hasan-bin-Muslim se suna, wo Safiya-binte-Sheba se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Ansar ki aik ladki ne shadi ki, wo bimar ho gaee thi jis se iske baal jhad gaey they un logon ne iske baalon ke sath baal jodney ka irada kya to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq sawal kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baalon mein jod lagaaney wali aur jod lagwaaney wali) donon ( par laanat farmai."
"5588","Zaid-bin-Hubab ne Ibrahim bin Naafe se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hasan-bin-Muslim-bin-Yunaq ne Safiya-binte-Sheba se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Ansar ki aik aurat ne apni beti ki shadi ki, wo bimar ho gaee to uske baal jhad gaey, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha ke uska khawind uski rukhsati chahta hai, kya main uske baalon mein jod laga dun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jodney waaliyon par laanat ki gaee hai."
"5589","Zaid-bin-Hubab ne Ibrahim bin Naafe se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hasan-bin-Muslim-bin-Yunaq ne Safiya-binte-Sheba se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Ansar ki aik aurat ne apni beti ki shadi ki, wo bimar ho gaee to uske baal jhad gaey, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha ke uska khawind uski rukhsati chahta hai, kya main uske baalon mein jod laga dun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jodney waaliyon par laanat ki gaee hai."
"5590","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Ibrahim bin Naafe se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : jod lagaaney waaliyon par laanat ki gaee hai."
"5591","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Ibrahim bin Naafe se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : jod lagaaney waaliyon par laanat ki gaee hai."
"5592","Ubaidullah ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jod lagaaney wali, jod lagwaaney wali, godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat ki."
"5593","Ubaidullah ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jod lagaaney wali, jod lagwaaney wali, godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat ki."
"5594","Sakhr bin Juweriya ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5595","Sakhr bin Juweriya ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5596","Jarir ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Alqama se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : ke Allah Taala ne laanat ki, godney waaliyon aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhedney waaliyon par aur ukhadwaaney waaliyon par aur daanton ko khoobsoorti ke liye kushaada karne waaliyon par (taake khoobsurat w kam-sin malum hon) aur Allah Taala ki khilqat ( paidaaish ( badalney waaliyon par. phir ye khabar bani Asad ki aik aurat ko pahunchi jisey Umme- Yaqoob kaha jata tha aur wo Quran ki qaariya thi, to wo saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aai aur boli ke mujhey kya khabar pahunchi hai ke tum ne godney waaliyon aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur munh ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur ukhadwaaney waaliyon, aur daanton ko kushaada karne waaliyon par aur Allah Taala ki khilqat ko badalney waaliyon par laanat ki hai? to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main is par laanat kyon na karun jis par Allah Taala ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat ki aur ye to Allah Taala ki kitab mein maujood hai? wo aurat boli ke main to 2 jildon mein jis qadr Quran tha, padh daala lekin mujhey nahi mila, to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tu ney padha hai to Allah Taala ka ye farman tujhey zaroor mila hoga ke , jo kuchh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhen batlaaein usko thaamey raho aur jisse mana karey us se baaz raho, (Hashr : 7) wo aurat boli ke un baton mein se to bahut-si baatein tumhari aurat bhi karti hai. saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ja dekh. wo unki aurat ke paas gaee to kuchh na paya. phir lot kar aai aur kehney lagi ke unmein se koi baat maine nahi dekhi, to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar aisa hota to ham unke sath mil kar na rehtey."
"5597","Jarir ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Alqama se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : ke Allah Taala ne laanat ki, godney waaliyon aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhedney waaliyon par aur ukhadwaaney waaliyon par aur daanton ko khoobsoorti ke liye kushaada karne waaliyon par (taake khoobsurat w kam-sin malum hon) aur Allah Taala ki khilqat ( paidaaish ( badalney waaliyon par. phir ye khabar bani Asad ki aik aurat ko pahunchi jisey Umme- Yaqoob kaha jata tha aur wo Quran ki qaariya thi, to wo saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aai aur boli ke mujhey kya khabar pahunchi hai ke tum ne godney waaliyon aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur munh ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur ukhadwaaney waaliyon, aur daanton ko kushaada karne waaliyon par aur Allah Taala ki khilqat ko badalney waaliyon par laanat ki hai? to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main is par laanat kyon na karun jis par Allah Taala ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat ki aur ye to Allah Taala ki kitab mein maujood hai? wo aurat boli ke main to 2 jildon mein jis qadr Quran tha, padh daala lekin mujhey nahi mila, to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tu ney padha hai to Allah Taala ka ye farman tujhey zaroor mila hoga ke , jo kuchh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhen batlaaein usko thaamey raho aur jisse mana karey us se baaz raho, (Hashr : 7) wo aurat boli ke un baton mein se to bahut-si baatein tumhari aurat bhi karti hai. saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ja dekh. wo unki aurat ke paas gaee to kuchh na paya. phir lot kar aai aur kehney lagi ke unmein se koi baat maine nahi dekhi, to saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar aisa hota to ham unke sath mil kar na rehtey."
"5598","Sufiyan aur Mufazzal bin mohlhil donon ne Mansoor se, isi sanad mein Jarir ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat bayan ki magar Sufiyan ki hadis mein : godney waaliyaan aur gudwaanewaaliyaan hai, jabke Mufazzal ki riwayat mein godney waaliyaan aur jin (ke jism) par gooda jata hai ke alfaz hain. ( maqsud aik hi hai.)"
"5599","Sufiyan aur Mufazzal bin mohlhil donon ne Mansoor se, isi sanad mein Jarir ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat bayan ki magar Sufiyan ki hadis mein : godney waaliyaan aur gudwaanewaaliyaan hai, jabke Mufazzal ki riwayat mein godney waaliyaan aur jin (ke jism) par gooda jata hai ke alfaz hain. ( maqsud aik hi hai.)"
"5600","Shoba ne Mansoor se isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, umme-Yaqoob (Raziallahu anhu) ke poorey waqiey ke baghair hi bayan ki hai."
"5601","Shoba ne Mansoor se isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, umme-Yaqoob (Raziallahu anhu) ke poorey waqiey ke baghair hi bayan ki hai."
"5602","Aamash ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Alqama se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah riwayat kya hai."
"5603","Aamash ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Alqama se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah riwayat kya hai."
"5604","abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurat ko apne sar (ke baalon) ke sath kisi bhi cheez ko jodney se sakhti ke sath mana farmaya."
"5605","abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurat ko apne sar (ke baalon) ke sath kisi bhi cheez ko jodney se sakhti ke sath mana farmaya."
"5606","Imam Malik (Rehmatullahi-alaih) Mina ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Muawiya bin Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se, jis saal unhon-ne Haj kya, suna, wo member par they, unhon-ne baalon ki kati hui aik lat pakdi jo aik muhaafiz ke hath mein thi (jisey auratein baalon se jodti thin) aur keh rahe they : Madina waalo! tumharey ulma kahan hain? maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, aap un ( laton wghaira) se mana farmatey they aur farma rahe they : jab Bani-Israeel ki aurton ne unko apnana shuru kya to wo halaak ho gaey. (jab jhoot ki buniyaadon par tameer aish aur nematon ka ye marhala aa gaya to zawaal bhi aa gaya.)"
"5607","Imam Malik (Rehmatullahi-alaih) Mina ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Muawiya bin Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se, jis saal unhon-ne Haj kya, suna, wo member par they, unhon-ne baalon ki kati hui aik lat pakdi jo aik muhaafiz ke hath mein thi (jisey auratein baalon se jodti thin) aur keh rahe they : Madina waalo! tumharey ulma kahan hain? maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, aap un ( laton wghaira) se mana farmatey they aur farma rahe they : jab Bani-Israeel ki aurton ne unko apnana shuru kya to wo halaak ho gaey. (jab jhoot ki buniyaadon par tameer aish aur nematon ka ye marhala aa gaya to zawaal bhi aa gaya.)"
"5608","Sufiyan-bin-Uena, Yunus aur Mamar, un sab ne Zohri se Malik ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya magar Mamar ki hadis mein : Bani-Israeel ko azab mein mubtala kar diya gaya ke alfaz hain."
"5609","Sufiyan-bin-Uena, Yunus aur Mamar, un sab ne Zohri se Malik ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya magar Mamar ki hadis mein : Bani-Israeel ko azab mein mubtala kar diya gaya ke alfaz hain."
"5610","Amr-bin-Murra ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) Madiney aaey, hamein khutba diya aur baalon ka aik guchchha nikal kar farmaya : main nahi samajhta tha ke yahood ke ilawa koi aur bhi aisa karta hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar pahunchi to aap ne usko jhoot (faraib kaari) ka naam diya tha."
"5611","Amr-bin-Murra ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) Madiney aaey, hamein khutba diya aur baalon ka aik guchchha nikal kar farmaya : main nahi samajhta tha ke yahood ke ilawa koi aur bhi aisa karta hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar pahunchi to aap ne usko jhoot (faraib kaari) ka naam diya tha."
"5612","Qatada ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki ke aik din Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : tum logon ne aik buri haiyat nikal li hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jhoot se mana farmaya hai, phir aik shakhs asaa liye huey aaya jiske sirey par kapdey ki aik dhajji (leer) thi. Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : suno! ye jhoot hai. Qatada ne kaha is se murad wo dhajjiyaan (leerein) hain jinke zariey se auratein apne baalon ko zyada karti hain."
"5613","Qatada ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki ke aik din Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : tum logon ne aik buri haiyat nikal li hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jhoot se mana farmaya hai, phir aik shakhs asaa liye huey aaya jiske sirey par kapdey ki aik dhajji (leer) thi. Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : suno! ye jhoot hai. Qatada ne kaha is se murad wo dhajjiyaan (leerein) hain jinke zariey se auratein apne baalon ko zyada karti hain."
"5614","saiyedna Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dozkhiyon ki 2 qismein hain jinko maine nahi dekha. aik to wo log jinke paas bailon ki dumon ki tarah ke kode hain, wo logon ko us se maartey hain doosrey wo auratein jo pahanti hain magar nangi hain (yani sattar ke laaiq libaas nahi hain), seedhi raah se bahkaaney wali , khud bahakney wali aur unke sar bakhti (oont ki aik qism hai) oont ki kohan ki tarah aik taraf jhukey huey wo jannat mein na jaeyngi balke uski khushbu bhi unko na milegi halanke jannat ki khushbu itni door se aa rahi hogi."
"5615","saiyedna Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dozkhiyon ki 2 qismein hain jinko maine nahi dekha. aik to wo log jinke paas bailon ki dumon ki tarah ke kode hain, wo logon ko us se maartey hain doosrey wo auratein jo pahanti hain magar nangi hain (yani sattar ke laaiq libaas nahi hain), seedhi raah se bahkaaney wali , khud bahakney wali aur unke sar bakhti (oont ki aik qism hai) oont ki kohan ki tarah aik taraf jhukey huey wo jannat mein na jaeyngi balke uski khushbu bhi unko na milegi halanke jannat ki khushbu itni door se aa rahi hogi."
"5616","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! (agar ( mein ye kahun : mujhey (ye sab ( mere khawind ne diya hai jo usney nahi diya? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo (khana) nahi mila, khud ko us se sair zahir karne waala, jhoot ke 2 kapdey pahnney waley ki tarah hai."
"5617","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! (agar ( mein ye kahun : mujhey (ye sab ( mere khawind ne diya hai jo usney nahi diya? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo (khana) nahi mila, khud ko us se sair zahir karne waala, jhoot ke 2 kapdey pahnney waley ki tarah hai."
"5618","Abda ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne Fatima se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik aurat aai aur us ne kaha : meri aik saukan hai, kya mujhey is baat par gunah hoga ke main khud ko apne khawind ke aisey maal se sair ho janey wali zahir karun jo usne mujhey nahi diya? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo nahi diya gaya us (maal ya khaney) se khud ko sair zahir karne wala jhoot ke 2 kapdey pahnney waley ki tarah hai."
"5619","Abda ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne Fatima se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik aurat aai aur us ne kaha : meri aik saukan hai, kya mujhey is baat par gunah hoga ke main khud ko apne khawind ke aisey maal se sair ho janey wali zahir karun jo usne mujhey nahi diya? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo nahi diya gaya us (maal ya khaney) se khud ko sair zahir karne wala jhoot ke 2 kapdey pahnney waley ki tarah hai."
"5620","abu-Usama aur abu-Muawiya, donon ne Hisham se, is sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"5621","abu-Usama aur abu-Muawiya, donon ne Hisham se, is sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"5622","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Baqi mein aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ko ya abul-Qasim keh kar awaz di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (is awaz par) us ( aadmi ( ki taraf mutwajjeh huey to us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! mera maqsud aapko pukaarna na tha, maine to falan ko awaz di hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5623","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Baqi mein aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ko ya abul-Qasim keh kar awaz di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (is awaz par) us ( aadmi ( ki taraf mutwajjeh huey to us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! mera maqsud aapko pukaarna na tha, maine to falan ko awaz di hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5624","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey naamon mein se Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zyada pasandida naam Abdullah aur Abdur-Rehman hain."
"5625","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey naamon mein se Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zyada pasandida naam Abdullah aur Abdur-Rehman hain."
"5626","Mansoor ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua, us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha, uski qaum ne us se kaha : tum ne apne betey ka naam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par rakha hai, ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey , wo shakhs apne betey ko apni peeth par utha kar) kandhey par chadha kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere yahan aik ladka paida hua hai maine iska naam Muhammad rakha hai, is par meri qaum ne kaha hai : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho . beshak main taqseem karne wala hun (jo Allah ata karta hai, usey ( tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5627","Mansoor ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua, us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha, uski qaum ne us se kaha : tum ne apne betey ka naam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par rakha hai, ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey , wo shakhs apne betey ko apni peeth par utha kar) kandhey par chadha kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere yahan aik ladka paida hua hai maine iska naam Muhammad rakha hai, is par meri qaum ne kaha hai : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho . beshak main taqseem karne wala hun (jo Allah ata karta hai, usey ( tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5628","Husain ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha ham ne us se kaha : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (is baat ki) ijazat ley lo. so wo shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke uske yahaan ladka paida hua hai, to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par uska naam rakha hai aur meri qaum ne is baat se inkar kar diya hai ke mujhey uske naam ki kunniyat se pukaarein yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat ley lo. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, beshak main Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan (Allah ka diya hua fazal) taqseem karta hun."
"5629","Husain ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha ham ne us se kaha : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (is baat ki) ijazat ley lo. so wo shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke uske yahaan ladka paida hua hai, to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par uska naam rakha hai aur meri qaum ne is baat se inkar kar diya hai ke mujhey uske naam ki kunniyat se pukaarein yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat ley lo. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, beshak main Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan (Allah ka diya hua fazal) taqseem karta hun."
"5630","Khalid Tahan ne Husain se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"5631","Khalid Tahan ne Husain se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"5632","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Aamash ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se hadis sunai unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, kyonke main hi abul-Qaasim hon tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun aur Abu-Bakar ki riwayat mein hai : apni kunniyat na rakho."
"5633","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Aamash ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se hadis sunai unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, kyonke main hi abul-Qaasim hon tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun aur Abu-Bakar ki riwayat mein hai : apni kunniyat na rakho."
"5634","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Qasim banaya gaya hun tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5635","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Qasim banaya gaya hun tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5636","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis sunai unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakhna chaha to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur aap se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Ansar ne achchha kya, mere naam par naam rakho, meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5638","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Muhammad-bin Amr bin jabla aur Bishr bin Khalid ne Muhammad-bin-Jafar se. Muhammad-bin-Jafar, ibne-abi Adi aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Qatada Mansoor Sulaiman aur Husain-bin-Abdur-Rehman se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, jis tarah un sab ki riwayat hai, jinki hadis ham pahley bayan kar chukey hain, Shoba se nazar ki bayan ki hui hadis mein hai kaha : usmein Husain aur Sulaiman ne izafa kya, Husain ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun. padhi. aur Sulaiman ne kaha : main hi Qasim hon, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5639","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Muhammad-bin Amr bin jabla aur Bishr bin Khalid ne Muhammad-bin-Jafar se. Muhammad-bin-Jafar, ibne-abi Adi aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Qatada Mansoor Sulaiman aur Husain-bin-Abdur-Rehman se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, jis tarah un sab ki riwayat hai, jinki hadis ham pahley bayan kar chukey hain, Shoba se nazar ki bayan ki hui hadis mein hai kaha : usmein Husain aur Sulaiman ne izafa kya, Husain ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun. padhi. aur Sulaiman ne kaha : main hi Qasim hon, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5640","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha : hamein ( Muhammad (bin Munkadir ne hadis sunai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan aik ladka paida hua, us shakhs ne iska naam Qasim rakha, ham ne kaha : ham tumhen abul-Qaasim ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. na (tumhari ye khahish poori karke) tumhari aankhen thandi karengey to wo shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye sab baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"5641","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha : hamein ( Muhammad (bin Munkadir ne hadis sunai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan aik ladka paida hua, us shakhs ne iska naam Qasim rakha, ham ne kaha : ham tumhen abul-Qaasim ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. na (tumhari ye khahish poori karke) tumhari aankhen thandi karengey to wo shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye sab baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"5642","Rooh bin-Qasim ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne ye alfaz nahi kahey : aur ham tumhari aankhen thandi nahi karengey."
"5643","Rooh bin-Qasim ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne ye alfaz nahi kahey : aur ham tumhari aankhen thandi nahi karengey."
"5644","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid , Zuhair-bin-Harab , aur ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho . Amr ne kaha Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha aur maine suna nahi kaha."
"5645","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid , Zuhair-bin-Harab , aur ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho . Amr ne kaha Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha aur maine suna nahi kaha."